    "type": "question",
    "label": "10",
    "prompt": "When the polynomial $P(x)=x^3+2x^2-5x+d$ is divided by $x-2$, the remainder is 10. Find the value of $d$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$d=4$",
      "worked": "By the remainder theorem, $P(2)=10$.\n$$\\begin{align*}2^3+2(2)^2-5(2)+d&=10\\\\8+8-10+d&=10\\\\6+d&=10\\\\d&=4\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
